+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who stay longer: a rental of 3 days or more should cost 10% less than its full price.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Rentals of 3 or more days get a 10% discount on the full price (dailyPrice × days). Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+- `quote` and `book` both return the discounted `total`, so a quote and the matching booking always agree.
+- Assumption: the discounted total is rounded to the nearest euro cent, halves rounding up, so it stays an integer number of cents.
+- Out of scope: other discount tiers, discounts by customer, showing the undiscounted price or the discount amount in results.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `rentals`: the total of quotes and bookings gains a long-stay discount. It is expressed as an added requirement because `rentals` is still being introduced by the unarchived change `add-rental-service`.
+
+## Impact
+
+Depends on `add-rental-service` (the service, `src/rental.ts` and its pricing do not exist yet). That change must be implemented and archived first. Touches `src/rental.ts` and `src/rental.test.ts`; no dependencies added.
